      r.out.includes('comparison consumption=n/a (no comparable coverage)') &&
      r.out.includes('difference=n/a (no comparable coverage)'),
      `C2 non-computable:\n${r.out}`);

    // C3:参考期后段任一成员下降 => 异常排除(优先于未知),只前半可比。
